Description: Hyperlite hypervisor (FastAPI + libvirt/QEMU-KVM)
 Hyperlite is a self-hosted web hypervisor: a FastAPI and libvirt backend
 with a React dashboard. This package installs or upgrades the application
 in /root/hyperlite, creates or refreshes its Python virtual environment and
 restarts its systemd service.
